 "_doc": "Băng Tâm Các's Effect engine records (world-depth Stage 6; ADR-0009). The input to tools/design/combat_sim/put_effects.py, which merges them into assets/data/combat_effects.json under source world-depth:bang_tam (rerun after an edit; same-source entries are replaced). Unpriced. Rule text from design/world/depth/sects/bang_tam.items.json.",
