  "The Keeper's Stillness": {
   "rule": "Ice Heart Regalia, full set: the first time each fight you fall to a quarter of your health, the foe's clock stops for 1.5 s (its arts, basic attack and companions wait; your arts keep recharging), and the foe gains 3 Ice stacks.",
